sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>(AI Gateway)
    participant ExtProc as ext_proc gRPC Server<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NeMo as NeMo Guardrails<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant LLM as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Platform auth (Kuadrant WASM)
    Gateway->>Envoy: Forward request
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ext_proc callout<br/>ProcessingRequest (headers + body)

    Note right of ExtProc: Plugin Pipeline:<br/>1. maas-headers-guard<br/>2. model-extractor<br/>3. model-provider-resolver<br/>4. stream-usage-enforcer<br/>5. api-translation<br/>6. apikey-injection

    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read provider credentials<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Secret data (API key)

    opt NeMo Guardrails enabled
        ExtProc->>NeMo: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>TLS 1.2+
        NeMo-->>ExtProc: Guardrail result
    end

    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(mutated headers + body,<br/>injected credentials)
    Envoy->>LLM: Forward to selected provider<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS (Istio SIMPLE)<br/>Auth: API key / SigV4 / OAuth2
    LLM-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    Note right of ExtProc: ExternalProvider CR created/updated

    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Watch ExternalProvider CRs<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read referenced Secret<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ExternalName Service<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Istio ServiceEntry<br/>(MESH_EXTERNAL)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Istio DestinationRule<br/>(TLS mode SIMPLE)

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 3: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    Note right of ExtProc: ExternalModel CR created/updated

    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Watch ExternalModel CRs<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Read ExternalProvider refs<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(attached to platform Gateway)
